{
  "name": "Meta WhatsApp - Renovar Token Cron",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 3,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "e1e2e3e4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "CRON DIARIO",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [0, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "get",
        "tableId": "SAAS_Config_ApiOficial",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "id",
              "keyValue": "1"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "e1e2e3e4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "CONFIG API OFICIAL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": { "id": "yzLw3CRWlDo2pmsj", "name": "Supabase [SAAS]" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "SAAS_Conexões",
        "returnAll": true,
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "apiOficial",
              "keyValue": "true"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "e1e2e3e4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "LISTAR CONEXOES OFICIAIS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [480, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": { "id": "yzLw3CRWlDo2pmsj", "name": "Supabase [SAAS]" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const config = $('CONFIG API OFICIAL').first().json;\nif (!config?.app_id || !config?.app_secret) {\n  throw new Error('Config API Oficial incompleta em SAAS_Config_ApiOficial.');\n}\n\nconst rows = $input.all().map((item) => item.json).filter((row) => row && row.id && row.access_token);\nconst now = Date.now();\nconst windowMs = 7 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000;\n\nconst toRenew = rows.filter((row) => {\n  if (!row.expires_at) return true;\n  const expiresAt = new Date(row.expires_at).getTime();\n  if (Number.isNaN(expiresAt)) return true;\n  return expiresAt - now <= windowMs;\n});\n\nif (!toRenew.length) {\n  return [\n    {\n      json: {\n        skip: true,\n        ok: true,\n        total: 0,\n        renewed: 0,\n        failed: 0,\n        message: 'Nenhuma conexao para renovar',\n        checked_at: new Date().toISOString()\n      }\n    }\n  ];\n}\n\nreturn toRenew.map((row) => ({ json: { ...row, skip: false } }));"
      },
      "id": "e1e2e3e4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "FILTRAR EXPIRANDO",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [720, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-skip",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.skip }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e1e2e3e4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "NADA PARA RENOVAR?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [960, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v25.0/oauth/access_token",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "grant_type", "value": "fb_exchange_token" },
            { "name": "client_id", "value": "={{ $('CONFIG API OFICIAL').first().json.app_id }}" },
            { "name": "client_secret", "value": "={{ $('CONFIG API OFICIAL').first().json.app_secret }}" },
            { "name": "fb_exchange_token", "value": "={{ $json.access_token }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e1e2e3e4-0006-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "RENOVAR TOKEN META",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1200, 420],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const conexao = $('FILTRAR EXPIRANDO').item.json;\nconst tokenRes = $input.item.json;\n\nif (tokenRes.error || !tokenRes.access_token) {\n  return [\n    {\n      json: {\n        ok: false,\n        conexaoId: conexao.id,\n        NomeConexao: conexao.NomeConexao || null,\n        error: tokenRes.error?.message || 'Falha ao renovar token na Meta.'\n      }\n    }\n  ];\n}\n\nconst expiresAt = tokenRes.expires_in\n  ? new Date(Date.now() + Number(tokenRes.expires_in) * 1000).toISOString()\n  : null;\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      ok: true,\n      conexaoId: conexao.id,\n      NomeConexao: conexao.NomeConexao || null,\n      access_token: tokenRes.access_token,\n      expires_in: tokenRes.expires_in || null,\n      expires_at: expiresAt\n    }\n  }\n];"
      },
      "id": "e1e2e3e4-0007-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "VALIDAR RESPOSTA META",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1440, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-ok",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e1e2e3e4-0008-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "RENOVOU OK?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1680, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "SAAS_Conexões",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "id",
              "keyValue": "={{ $json.conexaoId }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            { "fieldId": "access_token", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.access_token }}" },
            { "fieldId": "expires_in", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.expires_in }}" },
            { "fieldId": "expires_at", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.expires_at }}" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "e1e2e3e4-0009-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "ATUALIZAR CONEXAO",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1920, 340],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": { "id": "yzLw3CRWlDo2pmsj", "name": "Supabase [SAAS]" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const prev = $('VALIDAR RESPOSTA META').item.json;\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      ok: true,\n      conexaoId: prev.conexaoId,\n      NomeConexao: prev.NomeConexao,\n      expires_at: prev.expires_at,\n      renewed_at: new Date().toISOString()\n    }\n  }\n];"
      },
      "id": "e1e2e3e4-0010-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "RESULTADO SUCESSO",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [2160, 340]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const prev = $('VALIDAR RESPOSTA META').item.json;\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      ok: false,\n      conexaoId: prev.conexaoId,\n      NomeConexao: prev.NomeConexao,\n      error: prev.error || 'Falha ao renovar token'\n    }\n  }\n];"
      },
      "id": "e1e2e3e4-0011-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "RESULTADO ERRO",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1920, 520]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all().map((item) => item.json);\nconst renewed = items.filter((item) => item.ok === true && item.renewed_at).length;\nconst failed = items.filter((item) => item.ok === false).length;\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      ok: failed === 0,\n      total: items.length,\n      renewed,\n      failed,\n      results: items,\n      finished_at: new Date().toISOString()\n    }\n  }\n];"
      },
      "id": "e1e2e3e4-0012-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "RESUMO EXECUCAO",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [2400, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Renovação automática de tokens\n\nRoda **todo dia às 03:00**.\n\nRenova conexões `apiOficial=true` quando:\n- `expires_at` está a **7 dias ou menos** de vencer\n- ou `expires_at` está vazio/inválido\n\nUsa `SAAS_Config_ApiOficial` + `fb_exchange_token` (mesma lógica do webhook manual).\n\nRenovação manual continua disponível em `/webhook/meta-renovar-token`.\n\nCredencial: Supabase [SAAS]",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "e1e2e3e4-0013-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "NOTAS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-40, 20]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
